#coOwnerModal.modal.fade-in.show
  .modal-dialog
    .modal-content
      .modal-header
        h4.modal-title Make <b>{{ student.fullname }}</b> a Group co-teacher
        button((click)="closeModal.emit()", type="button", class="close") &times;
      .modal-body
        p By making {{ student.fullname }} a co-teacher of this Group, they will be able to access the teacher Tools, such as Heat Vision, and delete comments. Would you like to proceed?
      .modal-footer
        div(*ngIf="showError", class="alert alert-danger", role="alert")
          strong Error Updating User
          | There was an error upgrading the student to co-teacher, please try again or contact support.
        .btn-row.right
          button.btn((click)="closeModal.emit()", type="button", data-dismiss="modal") Cancel
          button#delBtnModal.btn.btn-primary((click)="closeModal.emit(); makeCoOwner(student);") Yes, make co-teacher